date-released: 2026-10-09

license: MIT

repository-code: https://github.com/dipankarsrirag/triage-sim

abstract: >
  TriageSim is an open-source speech and dialogue simulation framework for
  emergency department triage. It generates paired structured EHR → dialogue →
  accented speech data, enabling controlled evaluation of speech and language
  systems in healthcare. The framework supports multi-speaker persona-conditioned
  dialogue generation, phrase-break annotation for TTS, and accent-varied speech
  synthesis grounded in real-world clinical vignettes from MIMIC-IV-ED, ATS,
  and ETEK datasets.

keywords:
  - emergency medicine
  - triage
  - spoken dialogue simulation
  - speech synthesis
  - multi-speaker
  - accented speech
  - healthcare NLP
  - large language models

